{{Codex|Reverse-engineered from propulsion tech to pack a serious kick. Headshot kills trigger Overdrive, locking off secondary functions while maximizing your fire rate and ammo efficiency for a short time.}}

'''Athodai''' is a [[Tenno]] hand-cannon that shoots long-ranged laser beams, with an [[Alternate Fire]] function that discharges all ammo to burst-fire in a short-ranged cone. [[Enemy Body Parts|Weak point]] kills with the primary fire increase the weapon's [[fire rate]] and grant [[Ammo Efficiency|infinite ammo]], but locks out the Alternate Fire.

==Characteristics==
*This weapon deals primarily {{D|Heat}} damage.
*Primary Fire shoots fully automatic rounds.
**[[Enemy Body Parts|Weak point]] kills with primary fire trigger the '''Overdrive''' buff, increasing [[fire rate]] by '''+100%''', [[Ammo Efficiency|Ammo Efficiency]] by '''+100%''', and decreasing [[Recoil]] by '''-100%''' for '''8''' seconds. 
***'''Overdrive''' buff disables Alternate Fire for its duration, and cannot be refreshed.
***Fire Rate and Recoil bonuses are additive to mods.
*[[Alternate Fire]] shoots a cone of energy, ejecting all remaining ammunition in the magazine in a quick burst.
**Pinpoint [[accuracy]].
**Innate 2 meter [[Punch Through]].
**Cone has a thickness of 2 meters.
**Prevents [[zoom]].
***This prevents the buffs from {{M|Hydraulic Crosshairs}} and {{M|Sharpened Bullets}} from affecting this mode as a result.
*Can equip the Athodai-exclusive {{M|Pain Points}} mod.
*Innate {{Pol|Madurai}} polarity.

{{Advantages|
*Primary Fire tied with {{Weapon|Plinx}} for the fourth highest [[critical chance]] of all secondaries, behind {{Weapon|Akbolto Prime}}, {{Weapon|Knell Prime}} and a fully charged {{Weapon|Epitaph}}.
}}

{{Disadvantages|
*Alternate Fire has a limited range of 12 meters.
*Alternate Fire consumes 1 ammo per damage tick instead of 0.5, unlike most other continuous weapons.
*Extremely low ammo capacity; requires just 2 reloads to fully deplete all ammo reserves.
}}
{{WeaponComparison|Athodai Prime}}

{{Acquisition|Athodai was acquired by watching [[TennoCon/2020|TennoCon 2020]] on [https://twitch.tv/warframe WARFRAME's Twitch] with a [https://www.warframe.com/twitch/link Twitch-linked account] for 30 consecutive minutes, between 12:30 p.m. and 5:00 p.m. ET, on August 1st, 2020. It comes with a free weapon slot and pre-installed [[Orokin Catalyst]].
*Due to thousands of players reporting missing Twitch drops, on August 6th, 2020 Athodai was distributed to all players if they were logged in to WARFRAME during TennoCon 2020, regardless if they watched the streams or not.<ref>https://forums.warframe.com/topic/1211630-an-update-on-tennocon-2020-twitch-drops/</ref> This resulted in some players receiving ''two ''Athodai.

Athodai's blueprint and components are now available in [[Venus Proxima]] [[Abandoned Derelict Caches]] in [[Empyrean]] missions. All parts can be [[Trading|traded]] between players.}}

{{BuildAutomatic|type=Weapon|name=Athodai}}

==Notes==
*'''Overdrive''' buff grants '''+100%''' [[fire rate]], '''-100%''' [[Recoil]], and allows it to consume no ammo while firing, but disables the Alternate Fire feature. The buff lasts for '''8''' seconds.
**The buff triggers on enemy weak point kills, including kills made by hitting weak points generated by {{A|Sonar}} or {{M|Detect Vulnerability}}.
**Overdrive's fire rate buff is additive to other fire rate increases, such as {{M|Gunslinger}}, {{M|Lethal Torrent}}, {{WF|Gauss}}'s {{A|Redline}}, or {{WF|Wisp}}'s Haste {{A|Reservoirs}}.
**Duration '''cannot''' be refreshed.
**Overdrive takes precedence over {{Arcane|Arcane Pistoleer}}, preventing the Arcane from triggering.
*The [[Alternate Fire]] ejects ''all'' of the remaining ammunition in the magazine in a single burst.
**Because of this fact, increasing the magazine size of the weapon such as with {{M|Slip Magazine}} and using recoil reduction mods like {{M|Steady Hands}} can help to make its damage output more consistent and reliable.
**Alternate Fire can be interrupted (preserving the ammunition left in the magazine) by rolling or quick melee.
**Alternate Fire will not function under the effects of any ammo efficiency or infinite ammo buff ([[Energized Munitions]], Overdrive, Arcane Pistoleer, [[Void Fissure#Reactant Buff|Reactant Buff]]), instead firing only for few seconds or not firing at all.

==Tips==
*{{M|Hydraulic Crosshairs}} and {{Arcane|Secondary Deadhead}} pairs well with the primary fire's '''Overdrive''' buff.

