'''Astilla Prime''' is the [[prime]]d variant of {{Weapon|Astilla}}, acting as a direct upgrade. Astilla Prime was released alongside {{WF|Gara Prime}} and {{Weapon|Volnus Prime}}.

==Characteristics==
*This weapon deals primarily {{D|Impact}} damage.
*Fires a single slug every shot instead of individual pellets.
**Slugs have a guaranteed {{D|Impact}} proc.
*Slugs explode in a '''2.4''' meter radius after impacting a surface or enemy.
**Initial hit and explosion apply status separately.
**Explosion does not need direct line of sight to deal damage and will penetrate walls.
*Innate two {{Pol|Madurai}} and one {{Pol|Naramon}} polarities.

{{Advantages|class=Shotgun|
*Tied with {{Weapon|Astilla}} for the highest accuracy of all shotguns.
}}

{{Disadvantages|class=Shotgun|
*Has linear damage falloff from 100% to 50% from 60m to 100m target distance (distances are affected by [[Projectile Speed]]).
*Fewer status counts due to firing a single projectile instead of multiple pellets.
*Projectiles have travel time.
*Shatter area of effect cannot hit enemies behind the location of impact.
*Explosion inflicts [[Stagger|self-stagger]].
*Explosion has a [[Enemy Body Parts|headshot]] multiplier of 1x and cannot trigger headshot conditions.
*Explosion has linear [[Damage Falloff]] from 100% to 70% from central impact.
}}

